label "Agent as state graph diagram"
box start 16 106 60 40 "start"
box n1 110 40 100 44 "node|reads state, works"
box state 170 108 120 44 "shared state" acc
box n2 110 176 100 44 "node|returns updates"
box edge 250 40 110 44 "conditional edge"
box end 384 106 60 40 "end"
box ckpt 320 176 120 44 "checkpointer|saves state"
arrow start state
arrow state n1
arrow n1 edge
arrow edge n2
arrow n2 state
arrow edge end
arrow state ckpt dashed
note "nodes do the work, edges pick the next node, a checkpointer persists the state"
